---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Multiplayer Wordle – Play Wordle with Strangers Online | Airwalk Blog" description="Play multiplayer Wordle with strangers on Airwalk. Race to guess the word, chat while playing, and turn word games into friendships.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Airwalk</a>
      <a href="/chat" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition">Start Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 mt-20">
    <article class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Multiplayer Wordle: Race Strangers to Guess the Word</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Published on May 30, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Wordle is addictive alone. Multiplayer Wordle with a stranger? That's a whole different level. Airwalk brings competitive word-guessing directly into your chat sessions, turning a solo puzzle into a shared experience.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">How Multiplayer Wordle Works on Airwalk</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Both you and your chat partner get the same five-letter word to guess. You each have six attempts. You can see each other's progress in real time — the green tiles, the yellow tiles, the misses. First one to guess correctly wins. It's head-to-head Wordle with live reactions and trash talk built right in.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">The Ultimate Icebreaker</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Nothing bonds strangers faster than friendly competition. Multiplayer Wordle gives you an instant shared activity the moment you match. No awkward "so, where are you from?" — instead it's "how did you get it in three guesses?!" The game creates natural conversation topics that flow effortlessly into real connection.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Chat While You Play</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">The chat doesn't pause during the game. Send hints (or misleading ones), celebrate your wins, or commiserate over tricky words together. The combination of gaming and chatting creates a relaxed atmosphere where both players can be themselves without pressure.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Track Your Wins</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Airwalk keeps track of your Wordle win streak against strangers. Build your record, unlock bragging rights, and challenge new matches to beat your stats. It adds a layer of progression that keeps you coming back for one more round.</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Think you've got the vocabulary to win? Prove it against a stranger.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-800">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Ready to play Wordle with strangers?</p>
      <a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium transition">Play Wordle Now</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Airwalk. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
